  "worked_solution": "To write the fraction as a decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n74÷5\n$$\n\nWe proceed using long division as usual, stopping once we obtain a remainder of $0:$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,1\\,4\\,.\\,8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{7\\,\\phantom{|}4\\,.\\,0}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{74}{5}=14.8.\n$$",
